{"id":1448,"date":"2025-07-11T10:44:44","date_gmt":"2025-07-11T10:44:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/?p=1448"},"modified":"2025-07-11T11:25:11","modified_gmt":"2025-07-11T11:25:11","slug":"how-digital-screen-displays-can-increase-footfall-and-sales","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/how-digital-screen-displays-can-increase-footfall-and-sales\/","title":{"rendered":"How Digital Screen Displays Can Increase Footfall and Sales"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1448\" class=\"elementor elementor-1448\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a5618e2 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a5618e2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e89282a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e89282a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"695\">In a competitive retail landscape where attention is the new currency, <strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"466\">digital screen displays<\/strong> have become one of the most powerful tools to boost <strong data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"531\">footfall<\/strong> and <strong data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"554\">increase sales<\/strong>. Unlike traditional signage, digital displays are dynamic, eye-catching, and highly adaptable \u2014 turning passive shoppers into active buyers.<\/p><p data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"883\">Whether you&#8217;re running a boutique, pharmacy, electronics store, or supermarket, investing in digital signage isn\u2019t just a visual upgrade \u2014 it&#8217;s a proven driver of <strong data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"882\">retail performance<\/strong>.<\/p><p data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"1053\">Let\u2019s explore how digital screen displays work, why they increase in-store traffic, and how retailers in Ireland and beyond are seeing measurable returns on investment.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3aedf21 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3aedf21\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Retailers Are Turning to Digital Screen Displays<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d5d3c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3d5d3c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1450\">Digital screen displays are essentially electronic displays (LED or LCD) used to show real-time content like promotions, videos, product launches, menus, or even social proof. When placed strategically \u2014 in windows, at entry points, or throughout the shop \u2014 these displays guide customer attention and influence purchasing decisions.<\/p><p data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1679\">According to <strong data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1485\">Nielsen research<\/strong>, digital displays can increase brand awareness by <strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1549\">up to 47%<\/strong> and boost purchase amounts by <strong data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1589\">29.5%<\/strong>. In retail, that translates to more people walking in, staying longer, and spending more.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dd3b86f e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"dd3b86f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-319013c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"319013c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">1. Catch Attention and Drive Walk-Ins<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62ed786 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"62ed786\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1996\">One of the biggest challenges for brick-and-mortar retailers is stopping foot traffic in its tracks. A well-placed <strong data-start=\"1843\" data-end=\"1884\">ultra-high brightness digital display<\/strong> in a shop window is designed to <strong data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1941\">cut through sunlight<\/strong> and catch the eye of passersby \u2014 even from a distance.<\/p><h3 data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2023\">Real-World Example:<\/h3><blockquote data-start=\"2024\" data-end=\"2279\"><p data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2279\">A sportswear store in Dublin installed a <strong data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2109\">49\u201d high bright digital screen display<\/strong> in their window. By advertising flash sales and limited-time items, they reported a <strong data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2231\">22% increase in walk-in customers<\/strong> during weekends compared to the previous month.<\/p><\/blockquote><p data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2298\"><strong data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2298\">Why it works:<\/strong><\/p><ul data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2480\"><li data-start=\"2299\" data-end=\"2357\"><p data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2357\">Bright visuals grab attention faster than static signs<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2358\" data-end=\"2416\"><p data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2416\">Motion and video content are proven to boost retention<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2417\" data-end=\"2480\"><p data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2480\">Screens can rotate offers throughout the day to stay relevant<\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8a41be2 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8a41be2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29706ab elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"29706ab\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2. Highlight Promotions, Upsell, and Reduce Perceived Wait Time<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-74a6afa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"74a6afa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2692\">Once customers are inside, digital displays can help them discover more of your offerings \u2014 especially if they\u2019re in a queue or browsing.<\/p><p data-start=\"2694\" data-end=\"2774\">With <strong data-start=\"2699\" data-end=\"2737\">freestanding digital signage units<\/strong> or <strong data-start=\"2741\" data-end=\"2764\">shelf-edge displays<\/strong>, you can:<\/p><ul data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2976\"><li data-start=\"2775\" data-end=\"2832\"><p data-start=\"2777\" data-end=\"2832\">Upsell with bundle offers or \u201cbuy 2 get 1 free\u201d deals<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2865\"><p data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2865\">Promote new product arrivals<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2917\"><p data-start=\"2868\" data-end=\"2917\">Run countdown timers or flash sales for urgency<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"2918\" data-end=\"2976\"><p data-start=\"2920\" data-end=\"2976\">Entertain customers during wait times to reduce walkouts<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3 data-start=\"2978\" data-end=\"2999\">Stat Snapshot:<\/h3><blockquote data-start=\"3000\" data-end=\"3135\"><p data-start=\"3002\" data-end=\"3135\">A study by Intel found that <strong data-start=\"3030\" data-end=\"3091\">digital signage reduces perceived wait times by up to 35%<\/strong>, improving the overall in-store experience.<\/p><\/blockquote>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c8810b e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1c8810b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-06ff625 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"06ff625\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">3. Real-Time Flexibility = Better Sales Opportunities<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f08c9dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f08c9dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"3200\" data-end=\"3379\">Traditional printed signs are slow to update and wasteful. With digital screen displays, you can <strong data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3347\">change your entire marketing message instantly<\/strong> \u2014 across one store or hundreds.<\/p><p data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3412\">This flexibility allows you to:<\/p><ul data-start=\"3413\" data-end=\"3614\"><li data-start=\"3413\" data-end=\"3507\"><p data-start=\"3415\" data-end=\"3507\">Update content based on time of day (e.g. coffee offers in the morning, lunch deals by noon)<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3508\" data-end=\"3564\"><p data-start=\"3510\" data-end=\"3564\">React to weather (e.g. promote umbrellas or sun cream)<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"3565\" data-end=\"3614\"><p data-start=\"3567\" data-end=\"3614\">Align content with local events or sales trends<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"3616\" data-end=\"3784\">Retailers using <strong data-start=\"3632\" data-end=\"3651\">screenfusion.ai<\/strong>, our digital signage platform, can even control content remotely across multiple locations \u2014 with scheduling and analytics built in.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01ed347 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"01ed347\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4edec70 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4edec70\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">4. Social Proof &amp; Reviews Increase Buyer Confidence<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b2f9d3f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b2f9d3f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"3847\" data-end=\"4003\">Displaying <strong data-start=\"3858\" data-end=\"3883\">customer testimonials<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3910\">Google review ratings<\/strong>, or <strong data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"3939\">social media content<\/strong> on screens inside your store helps build trust and credibility.<\/p><p data-start=\"4005\" data-end=\"4038\">This is especially effective for:<\/p><ul data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4148\"><li data-start=\"4039\" data-end=\"4064\"><p data-start=\"4041\" data-end=\"4064\">Independent retailers<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4065\" data-end=\"4121\"><p data-start=\"4067\" data-end=\"4121\">High-ticket item shops (e.g. jewellery, electronics)<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4122\" data-end=\"4148\"><p data-start=\"4124\" data-end=\"4148\">Health &amp; beauty brands<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4218\">Customers are more likely to buy when they see others are satisfied.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecf83db e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ecf83db\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-125022f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"125022f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">5. Measurable ROI and Cost Savings<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ede63e2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ede63e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"4264\" data-end=\"4348\">Digital displays are not just about aesthetics \u2014 they offer <strong data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4347\">real business value<\/strong>.<\/p><h3 data-start=\"4350\" data-end=\"4379\">ROI Breakdown Example:<\/h3><p data-start=\"4380\" data-end=\"4501\">A small fashion retailer in Galway replaced printed posters with a <strong data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4477\">43\u201d digital screen display<\/strong> (\u20ac950). They estimated:<\/p><ul data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4723\"><li data-start=\"4502\" data-end=\"4552\"><p data-start=\"4504\" data-end=\"4552\">\u20ac250\/month savings on printing &amp; install costs<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4553\" data-end=\"4593\"><p data-start=\"4555\" data-end=\"4593\">18% uplift in promoted product sales<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4594\" data-end=\"4642\"><p data-start=\"4596\" data-end=\"4642\">Screen paid for itself in <strong data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4640\">under 4 months<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4643\" data-end=\"4723\"><p data-start=\"4645\" data-end=\"4723\">ROI boosted further using screenfusion.ai to rotate seasonal ads automatically<\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7758bf1 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7758bf1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62a3b00 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"62a3b00\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">6. Enhancing Brand Image and Customer Experience<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d6f0e7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2d6f0e7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4923\">A digital screen display does more than show information \u2014 it tells customers you\u2019re modern, professional, and invested in their experience.<\/p><p data-start=\"4925\" data-end=\"4965\">This kind of branding impression builds:<\/p><ul data-start=\"4966\" data-end=\"5072\"><li data-start=\"4966\" data-end=\"4986\"><p data-start=\"4968\" data-end=\"4986\">Customer loyalty<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"4987\" data-end=\"5011\"><p data-start=\"4989\" data-end=\"5011\">Higher average spend<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"5012\" data-end=\"5072\"><p data-start=\"5014\" data-end=\"5072\">Competitive advantage over shops without digital signage<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"5074\" data-end=\"5213\">As Irish consumer expectations evolve, <strong data-start=\"5113\" data-end=\"5140\">digital screen displays<\/strong> are no longer optional \u2014 they\u2019re the new standard for serious retailers.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-499ccf0 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"499ccf0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa8f74a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fa8f74a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ideal Digital Screen Display Types for Retailers<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a251822 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a251822\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"4783\" data-end=\"4923\">Here\u2019s a quick guide to what screen types work best in retail spaces:<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-09262fa elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"09262fa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t